       "en": "Oh how he moved through the wide sea",
       "en_mt": false
      },
      {
       "cyr": "со параходите.",
       "lat": "so parahodite.",
       "en": "With the steam ships",
       "en_mt": false
      },
      {
       "cyr": "Таму го пречекал министерот Барто",
       "lat": "Tamu go prečekal ministerot Barto",
       "en": "Waiting for him there was Minister Bartheu",
       "en_mt": false
      },
      {
       "cyr": "со генералите.",
       "lat": "so generalite.",
       "en": "With the generals",
       "en_mt": false
      },
      {
       "cyr": "Сојуз ќе прават, сојуз душмански,",
       "lat": "Sojuz ḱe pravat, sojuz dušmanski,",
       "en": "They will create a union, an adversarial union",
       "en_mt": false
      },
      {
       "cyr": "против жална Македонија.",
       "lat": "protiv žalna Makedonija.",
       "en": "Against poor Macedonia.",
       "en_mt": false
      }
     ]
    },
    {
